    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon of the Desirable Detainees</strong> is a love letter to classic turn-based RPGs, featuring grid-based movement, tactical combat, and a rich atmosphere dripping with mystery. These captives have their own sexy secrets \ud83d\udd1e, and not everything in this dungeon is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/eb91ac7e9024a165c2137198b4ae56b5.poster.avif?t=1751529877\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/eb91ac7e9024a165c2137198b4ae56b5.webm?t=1751529877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/eb91ac7e9024a165c2137198b4ae56b5.mp4?t=1751529877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Classic Turn-Based Combat:</strong> Plan every move carefully as you face off against attractive foes lurking in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 Grid-Based First-Person Dungeon Crawling:</strong> Explore the dark corridors of sprawling labyrinths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Puzzles and Traps:</strong> Outsmart the dungeon\u2019s many devious mechanisms to progress deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25 A Cast of Enigmatic Detainees:</strong> Meet a variety of charming, witty, and sometimes mischievous prisoners\u2014each with their own personality and motives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe\u00a0Retro Aesthetic with Modern Touches:</strong> Inspired by classic dungeon crawlers but enhanced for a smoother, more immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1e<strong>\u00a0Enjoy an erotic gaming experience suitable for adult audiences.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/e877e200f42172a20575221244ba35a7.poster.avif?t=1751529877\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/e877e200f42172a20575221244ba35a7.webm?t=1751529877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/e877e200f42172a20575221244ba35a7.mp4?t=1751529877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you save the dungeon's captives? Or will you lose yourself in its dark depths?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/e13ff559ed0af6d37c658f2a2ef56972.poster.avif?t=1751529877\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/e13ff559ed0af6d37c658f2a2ef56972.webm?t=1751529877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/e13ff559ed0af6d37c658f2a2ef56972.mp4?t=1751529877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508310/extras/81